[Submission5.Objectives]
Repel the enemy attack.
[Submission5.Description]
Your orders are:
- Eliminate the attacking enemy at Waypoint 3

To do so:
- Use the armored vehicle’s mobility and armor
- Use captured weapons and equipment
- Take the initiative and eliminate the enemy in a decisive counterattack

Note:
- In order to select which shells to fire in an armored vehicle, tank, or gun, left-click on the gun (a list of available shells used by this gun opens) and left-click on the shell of your choice. This will reload the gun with a round of the selected ammo type

SUN TZU’S “THE ART OF WAR”
Sun Tzu said:
It is a doctrine of war not to assume the enemy will not come, but rather to rely on one’s readiness to meet him; not to presume that he will not attack, but rather to make one’s self invincible.

