[Submission6.Objectives]
Destroy the enemy guns
[Submission6.Description]
Your orders are:
- Destroy the enemy guns at Waypoint 4
- Call for air support to destroy enemy guns

To do so:
- Select the available air support
- The following types of air support are available in the game: GROUND ATTACK AIRCRAFT,  FIGHTERS, BOMBERS, and SCOUTS 

Note:
- GROUND ATTACK AIRCRAFT are used for destroying enemy light-armored vehicles and guns
- FIGHTERS are useful for countering and destroying enemy aircraft
- BOMBERS are used to launch air strikes on fortified enemy positions
- SCOUTS are used for gathering intelligence from above the battlefield
- Do not send the armored vehicle forward since it can be easily destroyed at by the enemy guns

SUN TZU’S “THE ART OF WAR”
Sun Tzu said:
Should one ask: “Can troops be made capable of such instantaneous co-ordination?” I reply: “They can.” For, although the men of Wu and Yueh mutually hate one another, if together in a boat tossed by the wind they would co-operate as the right hand does with the left.
It is thus not sufficient to place one’s reliance on hobbled horses or buried chariot wheels.
To cultivate a uniform level of valour is the object of the military administration. And it is by proper use of the ground that both shock and flexible forces are used to the best advantage.
